{"id": "swebq0047", "pool": "swebq", "n_q_chunks": 3, "onset_chunk": 3, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "Pablo Picasso painted a variety of art, including cubism, still lifes, portrait s, and sculptures. He is famous for his work in the Cubist movement, which broke objects down into geometric shape s to represent them from multiple perspective s simultaneously. His style evolved over many decades, leading to works like Les Demo iselles d'Avignon and Guernica.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 24, "carrier_ended": null}
