{"id": "swebq0127", "pool": "swebq", "n_q_chunks": 3, "onset_chunk": 3, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "Spencer Pratt attended a few different schools during his youth. He went to high school in the United States, but he did not complete his education there. Later, he moved to Europe and spent time in countries like Germany and Italy as part of his early career journey, though formal schooling wasn't a primary focus for him at that point.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 18, "carrier_ended": null}
