{"id": "swebq0199", "pool": "swebq", "n_q_chunks": 2, "onset_chunk": 3, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "Picasso was influenced by a lot of different artists, including the Old Masters like Rapha el and Titian. He also drew inspiration from African sc ulpture and Cub ism, which he helped develop with his friend Braque.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 12, "carrier_ended": null}
